{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:98595","published":"2026-11-11T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-11-16T18:00:22.235254119Z","related":["CVE-2026-90616","CVE-2026-96275","CVE-2026-96280","CVE-2026-96808","CVE-2026-97023","CVE-2026-97024"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-90616","CVE-2026-96275","CVE-2026-96280","CVE-2026-96808","CVE-2026-97023","CVE-2026-97024"],"summary":"Important: flatpak security update","details":"Flatpak is a system for building, distributing, and running sandboxed desktop applications on Linux.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * flatpak: Flatpak: Arbitrary code execution via missing symlink protection (CVE-2026-90616)\n  * flatpak: flatpak: Arbitrary write access as root via extra-data extraction (CVE-2026-96275)\n  * flatpak: flatpak: Buffer overflow in OCI delta stream path names on 32-bit systems (CVE-2026-96280)\n  * flatpak: Flatpak: Local privilege escalation via symlink traversal in revokefs writer (CVE-2026-96808)\n  * flatpak: flatpak: Arbitrary file deletion in root context via path traversal in deploy directory export/bin (CVE-2026-97023)\n  * flatpak: flatpak: Arbitrary write in root context via path traversal in deploy directory files/etc (CVE-2026-97024)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"flatpak","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/flatpak"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.18.0-2.el10_3.4"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:98595.json"}},{"package":{"name":"flatpak-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/flatpak-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.18.0-2.el10_3.4"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/m